      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk what to do anymore. everyone just... gone. like one day we were all talking and the next day it's like i don't even exist to them. i've been staring at my phone for hours and no one even reacts to anything i post. i feel like a ghost. like i'm still walking around but i've already been erased.",
